Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:46:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [Hades][Settings] The help of two settings that moved in 1.2
 says where they were

LibreELEC Hades 1.2 put the settings of what goes out to a display in
the order of what goes out, in System > Display. Two of them were
elsewhere up to 1.1: "Adjust display HDR mode" in Player > Videos, and
"HDR to SDR: the display it is made for" in the Dolby Vision group. A
person who knew them there had nothing at the new place that said so
("takes some getting used to... the custom menus", from a user of 1.2).

Their help now ends with where they were up to 1.1, in English (#62502,
#61131) and in the three Spanish languages of Estuary (#54502, #52611,
with Estuary's English beside them). Nothing moves: every setting keeps
its place and its value. Kodi has no search of its settings in this
version, so an old name cannot be found by a search; the help is where
it is said.
---
